# Directories excluded from the Docker build context. Everything listed here
# is genuinely present in this repository — the previous version of this file
# opened with a paragraph explaining why `stufis-src/` and `helios-src/` must
# NOT be listed, and both of those, plus `mobile/`, left with the open-core
# carve. A note about the build requirements of Dockerfiles that no longer
# exist tells a reader this repo vendors third-party source trees. It does not.
#
# LICENSE and NOTICE are deliberately NOT excluded: gremion-ui/Dockerfile and
# gremion-public/Dockerfile COPY them into the runtime image (AGPL §4/§5).
k8s/
docs/
legal/
test/
scripts/

# Root node_modules (installed fresh inside container)
node_modules/

# Dev/build artifacts
.git/
.svelte-kit/
**/node_modules/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# Environment secrets
.env
*.env.local

# Editor/OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.DS_Store
